WEBVTT

00:06:59.858 --> 00:07:02.927
Guess what "itchy feet" does
to people's risk assessment

00:07:02.951 --> 00:07:04.580
of "heart attack" and "stroke"?

00:07:05.523 --> 00:07:07.092
It dilutes it.

00:07:07.116 --> 00:07:09.545
Imagine for a moment
an alternate commercial

00:07:09.569 --> 00:07:12.653
that says "This drug
cures your sleep problems,

00:07:12.677 --> 00:07:15.583
side effects are heart attack and stroke."

00:07:16.464 --> 00:07:17.614
Stop.

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:22.580
Now all of a sudden you're thinking,
"I don't mind staying up all night."

00:07:23.008 --> 00:07:24.140
(Laughter)

00:07:24.496 --> 00:07:27.512
Turns out going to sleep is important,

00:07:27.536 --> 00:07:29.408
but so is waking up.

00:07:29.432 --> 00:07:32.077
(Laughter)